#: minicli.cpp:832
msgid ""
"Running a realtime application can be very dangerous. If the application "
"misbehaves, the system might hang unrecoverably.\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Xebitandina sepaneke hevdem dibe ku xetere be. Heke sepan çewt bixebite, dibe "
"pergal bête miftekirin û hew bête rizgarkirin. Tu bawer dikî ku dixwazî "
"bidomînî?"

