"this option."
msgstr ""
"Heke te divê ji bo hemû sermaseyan heman rûerdê belî bikî, vê vebijêrkê çalak "
"bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 21
#: rc.cpp:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draw backgrounds per screen"
msgstr "Rûzemînan di her dîmenderê de xêz dike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 22
#: rc.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to draw to each screen separately in xinerama mode enable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu dixwazî ji hemû sermaseyan re bi heman awayî di moda xinerama de xêzan "
"çêkî, vê vebijêrkê çalak bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 26
#: rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Limit background cache"
msgstr "Pêşbîra rûerdê bi sînor bike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 27
#: rc.cpp:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to limit the cache size for the background."
msgstr ""
"Heke te divê ji bo rûerdê sînorekî ji pêşbîrê re belî bikî, vê vebijêrkê çalak "
"bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 31
#: rc.cpp:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background cache size"
msgstr "Mezinahiya pêşbîra rûerdê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enter how much memory KDE should use for caching the "
"background(s). If you have different backgrounds for the different desktops "
"caching can make switching desktops smoother at the expense of higher memory "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Tu dixwazî KDE ji bo rûerdan çiqas pêşbîrê bi kar bîne, li vir belî bike. Heke "
"ji bo sermaseyên cuda rûerdên cuda hebin, pêşbîr dikare di navbera sermaseyan "
"de ji bo bikaranîna bîra zêdetir nermahiyekê çêke."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show icons on desktop"
msgstr "Sembolên sermaseyê nîşan bide"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 39
#: rc.cpp:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu li sermaseyê sembolan naxwazî hilbijartina vê vebijêrkê rake. Heke "
"sembol tune bin dê sermase zûtir bixebite. Lê tê nikaribî sembolan kaş bikî ser "
"sermaseyê."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 43
#: rc.cpp:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow programs in desktop window"
msgstr "Li sermaseyê destûra bernameyan bide."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 44
#: rc.cpp:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu dixwazî vê vebijêrkê ji bo bernameyên wekî xsnow, xpenguin an jî "
"xmountain ku ji sermaseyê re xêzan çêdikin, bi kar bînî hilbijêre. Heke ji bo "
"mînakên wekî netscape dixebitin ku paceya kok kontrol dikin pirsgirêka te hebe, "
"vê vebijêrkê hilnebijêre."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 55
#: rc.cpp:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically line up icons"
msgstr "Sembolan bixweber têxe dorê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 56
#: rc.cpp:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to see your icons automatically aligned to the "
"grid when you move them."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu dixwazî sembol li sermaseyê bixweber têkevin dorê, vê vebijêrkê "
"hilbijêre."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 60
#: rc.cpp:131 rc.cpp:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort directories first"
msgstr "Pêşî pêristan veqetîne"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 71
#: rc.cpp:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr ""
"Bi bikaranînan guloka mişk li ser rûerda sermaseyê, bila sermase biguhere"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 72
#: rc.cpp:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can switch between the virtual desktops by using the mouse wheel over the "
"desktop background."
msgstr ""
"Li ser rûerdê sermaseyê bi bikaranîna guloka mişk tu dikarî di navbera "
"sermaseyên dîmenî de herî û werî."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 83
#: rc.cpp:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Terminal application"
msgstr "Sepana termînalê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 84
#: rc.cpp:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defines which terminal application is used."
msgstr "Belî dike ku dê kîjan bernameya termînalê bête bikaranîn."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 88
#: rc.cpp:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Left Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Çalakiya bişkojka çepê ya mişk"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 89
#: rc.cpp:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Tu dikarî çi qewimî hilbijêrî dema ku tu li ser bişkoka çepê ya lîstika "
"destnîşankirî ya sermaseya xwe bitikînî."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 93
#: rc.cpp:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Middle Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Çalakiya bişkojka navîn a mişk"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 94
#: rc.cpp:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Tu dikarî çi qewimî hilbijêrî bi tikandina pişkoka navê ya lîstika hilbijartî "
"ya ser masê."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 98
#: rc.cpp:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right Mouse Button Action"
msgstr "Çalakiya bişkojka rastê ya mişk"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 99
#: rc.cpp:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Tu dikarî hilbijêrî bê dema li ser maseyê te bişkojka rastê ya mişk tikand dê "
"çi bibe."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 105
#: rc.cpp:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE major version number"
msgstr "Hejmara guhertoya mezin a KDE"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 110
#: rc.cpp:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE minor version number"
msgstr "Hejmara guhertoya biçûk a KDE"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 115
#: rc.cpp:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDE release version number"
msgstr "Hejmara guhertoya lehêq a KDE"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 122
#: rc.cpp:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Normal text color used for icon labels"
msgstr "Rengê nivîsê yê asayî ji bo etîketên îkonê tê bikaranîn"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 126
#: rc.cpp:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background color used for icon labels"
msgstr "Rengê rûzemînê ji bo etîketên îkonan tê bikaranîn"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 131
#: rc.cpp:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable text shadow"
msgstr "Siya deqê çalak bike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 132
#: rc.cpp:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check here to enable a shadow outline around the desktop font. This also "
"improves the readability of the desktop text against backgrounds of a similar "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo li dora nivîsa sermaseyê sî hebe, vir nîşan bike. Ev wisa dike ku nivîsa "
"sermaseyê li ser heman rengê rûerdê xweştir xuya bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 145
#: rc.cpp:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show hidden files"
msgstr "Pelên veşartî nîşan bide"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 146
#: rc.cpp:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this option, any files in your desktop directory that begin "
"with a period (.) will be shown. Usually, such files contain configuration "
"information, and remain hidden from view.</p>\\n"
"<p>For example, files which are named \\\".directory\\\" are plain text files "
"which contain information for Konqueror, such as the icon to use in displaying "
"a directory, the order in which files should be sorted, etc. You should not "
"change or delete these files unless you know what you are doing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu vê vebijêrkê bitikînî, dê li sermaseyê hemû dosiyên bi xalê (.) dest pê "
"dikin xuya bikin. Ev dosya bi piranî ji bo mîheng û sazkirinê tên bikaranîn. "
"Heke tu nizanî tu çi dikî van dosiyan jê nebe. An jî naveroka wan neguhere.</p>"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 150
#: rc.cpp:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Align direction"
msgstr "Aliyê rêzkirinê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 151
#: rc.cpp:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, icons are aligned vertically, otherwise horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Heke ev bête çalakirin, dê sembol serberjêr bibin rêz, heke neyê çalakirin jî "
"dê li ser kêlekê bibin rêz."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 155
#: rc.cpp:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Icon Previews For"
msgstr "Ji bo pêşdîtinan sembolê nîşan bike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 156
#: rc.cpp:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select for which types of files you want to enable preview images."
msgstr "Cureyê dosiyên dê pêşdîtina wêneyên wan çalak bibe nîşan bide."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 170
#: rc.cpp:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort criterion"
msgstr "Pîvana rêzkirinê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 171
#: rc.cpp:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the sort criterion. Possible choices are NameCaseSensitive = 0, "
"NameCaseInsensitive = 1, Size = 2, Type = 3, Date = 4."
msgstr ""
"Hin krîteran dixebitîne. hilbijartina pêkan a rewşa hestiyariya nav = 0, rewşa "
"xemsariya nav = 1, Meznahî = 2, Cure = 3, Dîrok = 4."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 176
#: rc.cpp:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this to place directories in front of the sorted list, otherwise they "
"are amongst the files."
msgstr ""
"Bihêle ku wekî rehberan di serê lîsteya rêzkirî de were bicihkirin, heke na ew "
"di nava lîsteyê dene."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 181
#: rc.cpp:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this option if you want to keep your icons from moving."
msgstr ""
"Heke tu dixwazî sembolên de ji cihê xwe nelebitin vê vebijêrkê çalak bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 202
#: rc.cpp:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "Device Types to exclude"
msgstr "Cureyê amûrên dê li derve bên hiştin"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 203
#: rc.cpp:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "The device types which you do not want to see on the desktop."
msgstr "Cureyê amûrên tu naxwazî li sermaseyê bixuyin"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 211
#: rc.cpp:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "Current application's menu bar (Mac OS-style)"
msgstr "Darikê pêşeka sepana heyî (awayê Mac OS)"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 212
#: rc.cpp:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, applications will not have their menu bar attached "
"to their own window anymore. Instead, there is one menu bar at the top of the "
"screen which shows the menus of the currently active application. You might "
"recognize this behavior from Mac OS."
msgstr ""
"Dema ev hate hilbijartin, dê pêşekên sepanan ne di paceyên xwe de, lê li jora "
"dîmenderê, di nav pêşeka sepana hilbijartî de bixuyin. Kesên Mac OS bi kar "
"anîne dê bête bîra wan."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 218
#: rc.cpp:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop menu bar"
msgstr "Darikê pêşeka sermaseyê"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 219
#: rc.cpp:236
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, there is one menu bar at the top of the screen "
"which shows the desktop menus."
msgstr ""
"Heke ev vebijêrk bête hilbijartin, li jora sermaseyê darikekî pêşekan ê ku "
"pêşeka sermaseyê nîşan dide dê xuya bike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 225
#: rc.cpp:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable screen saver"
msgstr "Dîmendarparêzê çalak bike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 226
#: rc.cpp:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enables the screen saver."
msgstr "Dîmenderparêzê çalak bike"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 230
#: rc.cpp:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screen saver timeout"
msgstr "Ji bo dîmenderparêzê dem bihurî"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 231
#: rc.cpp:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the seconds after which the screen saver is started."
msgstr "Dembuhiriya dîmenderparêzê belî dike."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 235
#: rc.cpp:251
#, no-c-format
msgid "Suspend screen saver when DPMS kicks in"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 238
#: rc.cpp:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually the screen saver is suspended when display power saving kicks in,\n"
"       as nothing can be seen on the screen anyway, obviously. However, some "
"screen savers\n"
"       actually perform useful computations, so it is not desirable to suspend "
"them."
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "Disable screen saver during presentation or TV"
#~ msgstr "Di dema pêşkêşkirinê de an jî dema temaşeya Tv de destûrê nede dîmenderparêzê"

#~ msgid "Enable this option if you want to disable the screen saver while watching TV or movies."
#~ msgstr "Heke tu dixwazî di dema pêşkêşkirin û temaşeya Tv de dîmenderparêz nexebite, vê vebijêrkê çalak bike."
